A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 A1:0.5@0.95 R:1 A2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 A1:0.5 G1:0.5@0.8 A1:0.5@0.65 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 F1:0.5@0.95 R:1 F2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 F1:0.5 E1:0.5@0.8 G1:0.5@0.7 R:0.5
A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 A1:0.5@0.95 R:0.5 E2:0.5@0.65 A2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 A1:0.5 G1:0.75@0.8 R:0.75 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 F1:0.5@0.95 R:0.5 C2:0.5@0.65 F2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 F1:0.5 E1:0.75@0.8 R:0.75
A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 A1:0.5@0.95 R:1 A2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 A1:0.5 B1:0.5@0.75 C2:0.5@0.75 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 F1:0.5@0.95 R:1 F2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 F1:0.5 G1:0.5@0.75 E1:0.5@0.75 R:0.5
A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 A1:0.5@0.95 R:0.5 E2:0.5@0.65 A2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | A1:0.75 A1:0.75@0.7 R:0.5 A1:0.5 G1:0.5@0.8 A1:0.5@0.65 R:0.5 | F1:0.75 F1:0.75@0.7 F1:0.5@0.95 R:1 F2:0.5@0.8 R:0.5 | F1:1.5 R:0.5 F1:2

automate bass.cutoff
500 R:16 700:32@exp 1400:64@exp 450:0.1@step R:31.9 1600:48@exp 700:16@exp

# ---- lead: answers the choir. Bar 1 of each chord belongs to the sung
# note; the lead enters on a pickup into bar 2. One cell — two sixteenths
# into a long note — carries the whole line while its pitches develop:
# stated, raised a third, turned into a descent, lifted a sixth to E5 for
# the peak, then brought home to A. ----
track lead patch=claude-drive vel=0.7 len=1 gain=0.9 reverb_send=0.3
>A
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.75 R:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.75 D5:0.5 C5:1 | A4:1.5 R:2.5
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.25 D5:0.5@0.6 C5:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.75 D5:0.5 C5:0.5 D5:0.5@0.6 | C5:1 A4:1.5@0.65 R:1.5
>B
R:3.5 A4:0.25@0.5 B4:0.25@0.55 | C5:0.25@0.5 D5:1.75 R:0.5 C5:0.5@0.6 A4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.8 D5:0.5 C5:1 | A4:1 G4:0.5@0.6 A4:1 R:1.5
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1 D5:0.25@0.6 E5:0.25@0.6 D5:0.5 C5:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:0.75 | R:1 F5:1.5@0.8 E5:0.5 D5:1 | C5:1 A4:1.5@0.65 R:1.5
R:3.5 C5:0.25@0.5 D5:0.25@0.55 | E5:0.25@0.5 E5:1.75@0.85 D5:0.5 C5:0.5 A4:1 | R:1 E5:1@0.8 F5:0.5@0.7 E5:0.5 D5:1 | C5:0.5 A4:0.5 G4:1 A4:1 R:1
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.75 R:0.5 G4:0.5@0.6 E4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.8 D5:0.5 C5:1 | D5:1@0.7 C5:0.5 A4:1.5 R:1
>C
R:4 | R:1 E5:3@0.8 | R:0.5 D5:1.5@0.7 C5:2 | A4:2 R:2
R:4 | R:1 G5:2@0.85 E5:1 | R:0.5 F5:0.5@0.6 E5:1 D5:2 | C5:1.5 A4:2.5@0.7
>D
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.75 R:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.8 D5:0.5 C5:1 | A4:1.5 R:2.5
R:3.5 A4:0.25@0.5 B4:0.25@0.55 | C5:0.25@0.5 D5:1.75 R:0.5 C5:0.5@0.6 A4:1 | R:1 E5:1@0.8 F5:0.5@0.7 E5:0.5 D5:1 | C5:1 A4:1.5@0.65 R:1.5
R:3.5 C5:0.25@0.5 D5:0.25@0.55 | E5:0.25@0.5 E5:1.75@0.85 D5:0.5 C5:0.5 A4:1 | R:1 G5:1.5@0.85 E5:0.5 D5:1 | C5:0.5 A4:0.5 G4:1 A4:1 R:1
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.75 R:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.8 D5:0.5 C5:1 | A4:4@0.75

# dynamics: the bass and lead lift into B, step back for C, arrive fully in D and fall away
automate lead.gain
0.6 R:16 0.7:16@smooth 0.9:16@smooth R:48 0.7:8@smooth R:24 1.0:8@smooth R:40 0.75:16@smooth
automate bass.gain
1.0 R:16 1.15:32@smooth R:64 0.85:8@smooth R:24 1.3:8@smooth R:40 1.0:16@smooth
automate bed.gain
0.9 R:48 0.8:8@smooth R:56 1.0:8@smooth R:24 0.85:8@smooth R:56
automate lead.cutoff
1100 R:16 1300:32@exp 1900:64@exp 2300:32@exp 1900:64@exp

